1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
A chest CT on a CD. No report yet. Let's take a look.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:13,200
Free, open source, and fully on your own computer.

3
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:18,200
Open the scan and scroll through every slice.

4
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:23,200
One click: a nodule detector checks the whole chest.

5
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:27,800
It shows you where to look.

6
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:30,800
Slice 55, left lung, about 9 mm.

7
00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:35,200
A plain report to take to your radiologist.

